Z||000000||GT Bastard||02-28-2001||11:08 PM||||Finally got my new Gold '87 GT up and running a couple days ago with the help of Fierogod(he actually did most of it.)  After a couple minor complications, the car is driving.  She started up instantly and ran perfect the first time.  I took it on it's first drive around the block today.  It handles awesome and feels really solid.  We basically put together a stock 2.8 with a Crane Compucam.  It's still slow in comparison to my SE, but pretty snappy for an automatic.  <P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gtbastard.gif">    <P>"Save the planet. Go kill yourself."||||reg||1
